      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 334,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence1-334",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "沖性和順，事上謹肅，習於法令，政在平理，佐藩两人，鮮有失德，雖無赫赫之譽，久而見思，由是推重，累居二千石。",
      "reading": "傳稱和順、習法、平理而受推重。數位本「佐藩两人」，殿本「佐藩莅人」，兩讀各繫見證。",
      "note": "傳稱和順、習法、平理而受推重。數位本「佐藩两人」，殿本「佐藩莅人」，兩讀各繫見證。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 334,
      "end_codepoint": 387,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence1-387",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "又曉音樂，習歌舞，善與人交，貴游之中，聲名藉甚。",
      "reading": "又記通音樂、習歌舞、善交遊。",
      "note": "又記通音樂、習歌舞、善交遊。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 387,
      "end_codepoint": 411,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "侯景之亂，梁元帝於荊州承制，沖求解南郡，以讓王僧辯，并獻女妓十人，以助軍賞。",
      "reading": "侯景亂，沖向梁元帝請解南郡以讓王僧辯，獻女妓助軍賞。",
      "note": "侯景亂，沖向梁元帝請解南郡以讓王僧辯，獻女妓助軍賞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 38,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence2-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "元帝授持節、督衡桂成合四州諸軍事、雲麾將軍、衡州刺史。",
      "reading": "元帝授沖持節督四州諸軍事及雲麾將軍、衡州刺史。",
      "note": "元帝授沖持節督四州諸軍事及雲麾將軍、衡州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 38,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence2-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "元帝第四子元良為湘州刺史，仍以沖行州事，領長沙內史。",
      "reading": "元良為元帝第四子，任湘州刺史；沖行州事、領長沙內史。《梁書》本名方矩、改名元良。",
      "note": "元良為元帝第四子，任湘州刺史；沖行州事、領長沙內史。《梁書》本名方矩、改名元良。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 91,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
