      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "侯景平，授翊左將軍、丹陽尹。",
      "reading": "侯景平後授翊左將軍、丹陽尹。",
      "note": "侯景平後授翊左將軍、丹陽尹。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 91,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "武陵王舉兵至峽口，王琳偏將陸納等據湘州應之，沖為納所拘。",
      "reading": "武陵王紀舉兵，王琳偏將陸納據湘州響應並拘沖。梁元帝紀稱陸納為琳長史。",
      "note": "武陵王紀舉兵，王琳偏將陸納據湘州響應並拘沖。梁元帝紀稱陸納為琳長史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
