      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "納降，重授侍中、中權將軍，量置佐史，尹如故。",
      "reading": "陸納降，沖重授侍中、中權將軍，仍任丹陽尹。",
      "note": "陸納降，沖重授侍中、中權將軍，仍任丹陽尹。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 50,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
