      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "江陵陷，敬帝為太宰，承制以沖為左長史。",
      "reading": "江陵陷，梁敬帝以太宰承制，沖受左長史；太宰為敬帝官。",
      "note": "江陵陷，梁敬帝以太宰承制，沖受左長史；太宰為敬帝官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence4-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "紹泰中，累遷左光祿大夫、尚書右僕射。",
      "reading": "紹泰中遷左光祿大夫、尚書右僕射。",
      "note": "紹泰中遷左光祿大夫、尚書右僕射。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 37,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:received_sentence4-37",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "遷左僕射、開府儀同三司，侍中、將軍如故。",
      "reading": "遷左僕射、開府儀同三司，侍中、將軍如故。",
      "note": "遷左僕射、開府儀同三司，侍中、將軍如故。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 37,
      "end_codepoint": 57,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
