      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAA",
      "source_quote": "尋復領丹陽尹、南徐州大中正，給扶。",
      "reading": "復領丹陽尹、南徐州大中正，給扶。",
      "note": "復領丹陽尹、南徐州大中正，給扶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangchong-complete:p004",
